# shadcn/ui

This project uses **shadcn/ui** (Base UI / Nova style) with Tailwind CSS.

- Prefer components from `@/components/ui/*` (e.g. `Button`, `Input`, `Tabs`, `DropdownMenu`, `Popover`, `ScrollArea`).
- Use `cn` from `@/lib/utils` for className merging.
- Toasts via `sonner` (`toast` from `sonner`, `<Toaster />` from `@/components/ui/sonner`).
- Icons from `lucide-react`.
- Follow patterns in the [shadcn docs](https://ui.shadcn.com/).
